		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>J&#039;essaye de faire un backup de notre base de données avec ce script <a href="https://gist.github.com/matthewlehner/3091458" rel="nofollow">https://gist.github.com/matthewlehner/3091458</a><br />J&#039;ai des erreurs d&#039;exécution comme :<br />$ sh autopgsqlbackup<br />autopgsqlbackup: line 261: pg_dump -U postgres $HOST $OPT $1 &gt; $2: command not found<br />autopgsqlbackup: line 261: pg_dump -U postgres $HOST $OPT $1 &gt; $2: command not found<br />autopgsqlbackup: line 261: pg_dump -U postgres $HOST $OPT $1 &gt; $2: command not found<br />autopgsqlbackup: line 261: pg_dump -U postgres $HOST $OPT $1 &gt; $2: command not found<br />autopgsqlbackup: line 261: pg_dump -U postgres $HOST $OPT $1 &gt; $2: command not found<br />autopgsqlbackup: line 261: pg_dump -U postgres $HOST $OPT $1 &gt; $2: command not found<br />autopgsqlbackup: line 261: pg_dump -U postgres $HOST $OPT $1 &gt; $2: command not found<br />autopgsqlbackup: line 398: /*.lundi.sql.*: No such file or directory<br />autopgsqlbackup: line 261: pg_dump -U postgres $HOST $OPT $1 &gt; $2: command not found<br />autopgsqlbackup: line 261: pg_dump -U postgres $HOST $OPT $1 &gt; $2: command not found<br />autopgsqlbackup: line 261: pg_dump -U postgres $HOST $OPT $1 &gt; $2: command not found<br />autopgsqlbackup: eval: line 398: unexpected EOF while looking for matching `&quot;&#039;<br />autopgsqlbackup: eval: line 399: syntax error: unexpected end of file</p><p>Pourriez vous m&#039;aidez s&#039;il vous plais ou bien si vous avez un autre exemplaire de script plus complet. <br />Merci</p>]]></content>
